/* ── Commission record status badges ── */
.badge-commission-pending   { background: oklch(70% 0.16 72  / 0.12); color: oklch(75% 0.14 72);  border: 1px solid oklch(70% 0.16 72  / 0.3); }
.badge-commission-approved  { background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.12); color: oklch(72% 0.18 292); border: 1px solid oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.3); }
.badge-commission-paid      { background: oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.14 145); border: 1px solid oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.3); }
.badge-commission-cancelled { background: oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.02 264); border: 1px solid oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.3); }
.badge-commission-disputed  { background: oklch(55% 0.22 27  / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.18 27);  border: 1px solid oklch(55% 0.22 27  / 0.3); }

/* ── Adjustment kind badges ── */
.badge-adj-bonus       { background: oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.14 145); border: 1px solid oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.3); }
.badge-adj-penalty     { background: oklch(55% 0.22 27  / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.18 27);  border: 1px solid oklch(55% 0.22 27  / 0.3); }
.badge-adj-correction  { background: oklch(60% 0.22 230 / 0.12); color: oklch(68% 0.18 230); border: 1px solid oklch(60% 0.22 230 / 0.3); }
.badge-adj-guest-split { background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.12); color: oklch(72% 0.18 292); border: 1px solid oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.3); }
.badge-adj-other       { background: oklch(60% 0.02 264 / 0.12); color: oklch(68% 0.02 264); border: 1px solid oklch(60% 0.02 264 / 0.3); }

/* ── Rule match type pill ── */
.pill-rule-service-specific { background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.12); color: oklch(72% 0.18 292); border: 1px solid oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.3); }
.pill-rule-catch-all        { background: oklch(60% 0.22 230 / 0.12); color: oklch(68% 0.18 230); border: 1px solid oklch(60% 0.22 230 / 0.3); }
.pill-rule-artist-default   { background: oklch(70% 0.16 72  / 0.12); color: oklch(75% 0.14 72);  border: 1px solid oklch(70% 0.16 72  / 0.3); }
.pill-rule-none             { background: oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.02 264); border: 1px solid oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.3); }

/* ── Dispute status badges ── */
.badge-dispute-open      { background: oklch(70% 0.16 72  / 0.12); color: oklch(75% 0.14 72);  border: 1px solid oklch(70% 0.16 72  / 0.3); }
.badge-dispute-resolved  { background: oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.14 145); border: 1px solid oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.3); }
.badge-dispute-dismissed { background: oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.02 264); border: 1px solid oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.3); }

/* ── Commission preview card ── */
.commission-preview {
  background: var(--color-preview-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-preview-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
}
.commission-preview-label {
  color: var(--color-preview-label);
  font-size: 0.6875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.commission-preview-value {
  color: var(--color-preview-value);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.commission-preview-total {
  color: var(--color-preview-total);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* ── Bulk approval sticky footer ── */
.bulk-action-footer {
  position: sticky;
  bottom: 0;
  background: var(--color-bulk-footer-bg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-bulk-footer-border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  z-index: 20;
}

/* ── Rule timeline bar ── */
.rule-timeline-segment {
  height: 4px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  transition: opacity 150ms ease-out;
}
.rule-timeline-active  { background: var(--color-timeline-active); }
.rule-timeline-past    { background: var(--color-timeline-past); }
.rule-timeline-future  { background: var(--color-timeline-future); }
```

---

## 2. New shadcn Installs

```bash
# Verify before running — skip if already present
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add slider          # tip split percentage slider
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add date-picker     # effective-from / effective-until (verify if DatePicker primitive exists; if not, compose Popover + Calendar)
```

All other primitives confirmed from Sprints 1–6: Tabs, DataTable, Dialog, Sheet, Button, Badge, Skeleton, Tooltip, AlertDialog, ScrollArea, Switch, Select, Input, Textarea, Separator, Popover, Command, DropdownMenu, Table, Toggle, Avatar, RadioGroup, Calendar.

---

## 3. Commissions Hub — `/commissions`

### 3a. Layout wireframe

```
┌─ AppHeader ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Commissions          [Period: This Month ▾]           [Export ↓]  [+ Add]    │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ Tabs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Dashboard   Records   Rules   Adjustments   Disputes                         │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

[Tab content — Section 4–8 below]
```

### 3b. Page header component

```tsx
// app/(app)/commissions/page.tsx — Server Component
// Renders <CommissionsLayout> which includes AppHeader + tab shell

<div className="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-border">
  <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Commissions</h1>
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <PeriodSelector />   {/* Select: This Week / This Month / Last Month / Custom */}
    <Button variant="outline" size="sm">
      <Download className="h-4 w-4 mr-1.5" />
      Export
    </Button>
    {/* Owner/admin only — hidden for artist role */}
    {canDo('commissions.manage') && (
      <Button size="sm">
        <Plus className="h-4 w-4 mr-1.5" />
        Add
      </Button>
    )}
  </div>
</div>
```

`PeriodSelector` is a `<Select>` that drives a `?period=` URL search param. Options:
- `this_week` — current ISO week
- `this_month` — current calendar month (default)
- `last_month`
- `custom` — expands to a date range picker (two `<Calendar>` popovers)

Tab structure:

```tsx
<Tabs defaultValue="dashboard" className="mt-0">
  <TabsList className="w-full justify-start border-b rounded-none bg-transparent h-auto px-6 gap-0">
    <TabsTrigger value="dashboard"    className="rounded-none border-b-2 border-transparent data-[state=active]:border-primary px-4 pb-3 pt-0 text-sm font-medium">Dashboard</TabsTrigger>
    <TabsTrigger value="records"      ...>Records</TabsTrigger>
    <TabsTrigger value="rules"        ...>Rules</TabsTrigger>
    <TabsTrigger value="adjustments"  ...>Adjustments</TabsTrigger>
    <TabsTrigger value="disputes"     ...>
      Disputes
      {openDisputeCount > 0 && (
        <span className="ml-1.5 h-4 min-w-4 rounded-full bg-destructive/20 text-destructive text-[10px] font-semibold tabular-nums px-1">
          {openDisputeCount}
        </span>
      )}
    </TabsTrigger>
  </TabsList>
  <TabsContent value="dashboard">    <CommissionDashboardTab />    </TabsContent>
  <TabsContent value="records">      <CommissionRecordsTab />      </TabsContent>
  <TabsContent value="rules">        <CommissionRulesTab />         </TabsContent>
  <TabsContent value="adjustments">  <CommissionAdjustmentsTab />  </TabsContent>
  <TabsContent value="disputes">     <CommissionDisputesTab />      </TabsContent>
</Tabs>
```

Artist-role note: The "Disputes" tab is visible to artists. The "Rules" tab is visible but read-only. The "Adjustments" tab shows only their own adjustments. The header "Add" button and "Export" button are hidden for the artist role.

---

## 4. Dashboard Tab

### 4a. KPI row wireframe

```
┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐
│ Total Earned │ │  Pending     │ │  Paid Out    │ │  Adjustments │
│  $4,280      │ │  $1,120  12  │ │  $3,160      │ │  +$240       │
│  this month  │ │  awaiting    │ │  this month  │ │  net this mo │
└──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘
```

**Artist-role variant** — same 4 cards but scoped to `get_artist_commission_summary` result for the current artist. Labels change: "Your Earnings", "Your Pending", "Paid to You", "Your Adjustments".

### 4b. KPI card spec

Same `.kpi-card-hover` pattern from Sprint 1:

```tsx
<Card className="group relative cursor-default hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors duration-150 shadow-soft">
  <CardContent className="p-5">
    <p className="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">
      {label}
    </p>
    <p className="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight tabular-nums">
      {formatCurrency(value)}
    </p>
    {subLabel && (
      <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 tabular-nums">{subLabel}</p>
    )}
  </CardContent>
