## 12. Adjustment Modal

`CommissionAdjustmentModal` is a `<Dialog>` (not a Sheet — it's a focused form).

```tsx
<Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>
  <DialogContent className="sm:max-w-[460px]">
    <DialogHeader>
      <DialogTitle>Add Adjustment</DialogTitle>
      <DialogDescription className="text-xs">
        Manually add a bonus, penalty, or correction to an artist's commission.
      </DialogDescription>
    </DialogHeader>

    <div className="space-y-4 py-2">
      {/* Artist */}
      <div className="space-y-1.5">
        <Label className="text-xs font-medium">Artist <span className="text-destructive">*</span></Label>
        <Select value={form.artistId} onValueChange={...}>
          {/* Artist list with avatars */}
        </Select>
      </div>

      {/* Kind */}
      <div className="space-y-1.5">
        <Label className="text-xs font-medium">Kind <span className="text-destructive">*</span></Label>
        <RadioGroup value={form.kind} onValueChange={...} className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
          {(['bonus', 'penalty', 'correction', 'guest_split', 'other'] as const).map(k => (
            <label key={k} className="flex items-center gap-1.5 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border cursor-pointer text-xs hover:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:border-primary/60 has-[:checked]:bg-primary/[0.04]">
              <RadioGroupItem value={k} />
              {kindLabel(k)}
            </label>
          ))}
        </RadioGroup>
      </div>

      {/* Amount */}
      <div className="space-y-1.5">
        <Label className="text-xs font-medium">Amount <span className="text-destructive">*</span></Label>
        <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
          {/* Sign toggle */}
          <Button
            type="button"
            variant="outline"
            size="sm"
            className={cn('w-8 h-9 shrink-0 font-bold tabular-nums', form.isNegative ? 'text-destructive border-destructive/40' : 'text-[oklch(58%_0.18_145)] border-[oklch(58%_0.18_145/0.4)]')}
            onClick={() => setForm(f => ({ ...f, isNegative: !f.isNegative }))}
          >
            {form.isNegative ? '−' : '+'}
          </Button>
          <div className="relative flex-1">
            <span className="absolute left-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">$</span>
            <Input
              type="number" min="0" step="0.01"
              value={form.amountDollars}
              onChange={...}
              className={cn('pl-6 tabular-nums', form.isNegative && 'text-destructive')}
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <p className="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">
          Penalty = negative (deducts from artist). Bonus = positive (adds to artist).
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Reason */}
      <div className="space-y-1.5">
        <Label className="text-xs font-medium">Reason <span className="text-destructive">*</span></Label>
        <Textarea
          value={form.reason}
          onChange={...}
          placeholder="Briefly explain this adjustment…"
          className="resize-none h-20 text-sm"
          maxLength={500}
        />
        <p className="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground text-right tabular-nums">{form.reason.length}/500</p>
      </div>

      {/* Applied date */}
      <div className="space-y-1.5">
        <Label className="text-xs font-medium">Applied date</Label>
        <DatePicker value={form.appliedDate} onChange={...} defaultValue={new Date()} />
      </div>

      {/* Preview */}
      {form.artistId && form.amountDollars > 0 && (
        <div className="commission-preview">
          <p className="commission-preview-label mb-1">Preview</p>
          <p className="text-sm text-foreground">
            This will{' '}
            <span className={form.isNegative ? 'text-destructive font-semibold' : 'text-[oklch(58%_0.18_145)] font-semibold'}>
              {form.isNegative ? 'deduct' : 'add'}
            </span>
            {' '}<span className="tabular-nums font-semibold">{formatCurrency(Math.round(form.amountDollars * 100))}</span>
            {' '}{form.isNegative ? 'from' : 'to'}{' '}
            <span className="font-semibold">{selectedArtist?.display_name ?? '—'}</span>'s next payout.
          </p>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>

    <DialogFooter>
      <Button variant="outline" onClick={() => setOpen(false)}>Cancel</Button>
      <Button onClick={handleSave} disabled={isPending || !form.artistId || !form.amountDollars || !form.reason}>
        {isPending && <Loader2 className="h-4 w-4 mr-1.5 animate-spin" />}
        Add adjustment
      </Button>
    </DialogFooter>
  </DialogContent>
</Dialog>
```

Penalty `kind` is auto-selected when `form.isNegative === true`. Bonus auto-selects when positive. These auto-select only if the user hasn't manually chosen a kind.

