### 13b. Dispute Resolution Drawer

`DisputeResolutionDrawer` — `<Sheet side="right">` with `max-w-[500px]`.

Visible to owner/admin only. Artist sees a read-only view (no resolution actions).

```
┌─ Header ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Dispute #[short-id]              [open]                                  │
│ Raised by Maya Lopez · Apr 15, 2026                                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ Commission record (read-only) ─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Same DetailRow layout as Section 10c                                     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ Dispute reason ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ "[The calculation looks wrong — I was told my rate was 65%, not 60%]"   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ Resolution (open disputes only — owner/admin) ─────────────────────────┐
│ Outcome:                                                                  │
│  ○ Uphold — The artist's complaint is valid. The commission record will  │
│    be reset to 'pending' for recalculation and re-approval.              │
│  ○ Dismiss — The original calculation stands. The commission record      │
│    is restored to 'approved'.                                            │
│                                                                           │
│ Resolution notes (required for uphold, optional for dismiss)             │
│ [Textarea]                                                                │
│                                                                           │
│                         [Cancel]  [Resolve dispute →]                    │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

